[{"id":"CN-TR-014","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","MSS","MTU","抓包"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>在 TCP 抓包中，如何用 MSS 与路径反馈定位大包黑洞？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先比较两端 SYN/SYN-ACK 的 MSS，再观察实际 TCP 载荷、IP 包大小，以及是否出现 ICMP Packet Too Big 或需要分片反馈。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这张卡关注传输层证据链：MSS 是端点在握手中表达的 TCP 载荷上限，MTU 是路径/链路约束，PMTUD 依赖路径反馈。没有反馈时还要考虑 ICMP 过滤、隧道开销和中间设备策略；先分别判断这三个概念，再把它们放回抓包字段和路径反馈中。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a11-array","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["Bash","数组"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Indexed arrays 和 Associative arrays 何时使用？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>整数顺序索引用 Indexed arrays，字符串键查值用 Associative arrays。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>遍历时保留数组元素边界，不要依赖把数组拼成空格分隔字符串。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-05-users-without-orders-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["LEFT JOIN","NOT EXISTS","反连接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>查询从未下过订单的用户，要求每个用户只返回一次。SQL 应该怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"lang-sql\">SELECT u.id, u.email\nFROM users AS u\nWHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders AS o WHERE o.user_id = u.id)\nORDER BY u.id;\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>EXISTS 只回答是否存在，不会因为一个用户有多笔订单而产生重复；LEFT JOIN 方案要把右表条件放在 ON 中，且不能使用 \u003ccode>COUNT(*)\u003c/code> 判断无订单。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-context-isolation","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["BrowserContext","测试隔离"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(七)浏览器上下文.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(七)浏览器上下文","articlePath":"posts/8dafa0dc/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>BrowserContext 隔离是否等于测试数据隔离？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不等于，它只负责浏览器端会话隔离。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>数据库记录、缓存、消息队列和第三方沙箱仍可能共享。测试必须使用唯一数据标识，并由创建数据的 Fixture 负责清理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-install-layers","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["安装","环境"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么安装 \u003ccode>pytest-playwright\u003c/code> 后还要运行 \u003ccode>playwright install\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>前者安装 Python 包，后者下载匹配的浏览器二进制。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Playwright 客户端、浏览器二进制和 Linux 系统依赖是三层资源。只完成其中一层，测试仍可能在启动浏览器时失败。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-drag-choice","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["拖拽","鼠标"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>标准拖拽组件首先应尝试哪种方式？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>A\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>高层 \u003ccode>drag_to()\u003c/code> 更接近用户行为并保留 Playwright 的定位与可操作性检查；仅在组件需要特殊指针轨迹时降级到底层鼠标操作。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["A"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>source.drag_to(target)\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>固定屏幕绝对坐标\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>直接修改目标 DOM\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"playwright-wait-boundary","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["自动等待","断言"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 \u003ccode>click()\u003c/code> 成功后仍然需要断言？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>自动等待只保证动作可执行，不保证业务结果正确。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>点击会等待元素可操作并发送输入事件；成功提示、URL、订单状态或后端数据属于动作后的业务结果，需要单独使用 Web-first 断言或 API 核验。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]